    <description>Quick Action screen flow launched from a customer Contact by the Sales Receptionist. recordId is the Contact&apos;s Id; Get_Contact resolves it to that Contact&apos;s Account (Get_Account) since the Opportunity is created under the Account, not the Contact. Captures Brand, Showroom, and Sales Representative, then creates the Opportunity directly under that Account and assigns it to the chosen rep, triggering both an assignment notification Task and a real-time Custom Notification (customNotificationAction, type AF_NT_Alfardan_Alert — same pattern as AF_FL_Lead_QueueRouting/AF_FL_Lead_NotifyOnAssignment) to that rep. Duplicate-opportunity flagging and Showroom Manager notification are handled centrally by AF_FL_Opp_AfterCreate, not duplicated here.</description>
